# Line endings are content here, not formatting.
#
# The route-classification suite parses the gateway's own source as text to prove every mounted
# route states an auth class, and the provisioning scripts are executed as text by a shell. Git
# hands a Windows checkout CRLF by default, which turned that suite red on a platform difference
# that had nothing to do with what it asserts, and would break a shell script outright.
#
# text=auto still lets git detect and leave binaries alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt to that braces: never touch these, whatever detection thinks.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
